    "detailed_description": "Buddy and Lucky love capturing joyful moments of their friends practicing all kinds of sports. With their camera always ready, they turn these fun memories into charming pixel-art photographs \u2014 and you\u2019re invited to help develop them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe photos are already taken, but it\u2019s up to you to bring each scene to life \u2014 character by character, pixel by pixel \u2014 transforming simple silhouettes into colorful snapshots full of personality.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Choose from 10 unique photos full of friendship, fun, and sports<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Color over 60 characters across 10 vibrant photos, each filled with style and movement<br />\r\n\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Use cozy, intuitive tools like the Eye and Lock buttons to paint at your pace<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Relax with a lighthearted soundtrack composed by Taty Jaques<br />\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Enjoy delightful pixel art created by K\u00e1tia Numakura<br />\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 Complete your collection and fill the photo album with your finished creations<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you\u2019re into coloring, pixel art, or just looking for a relaxing moment, join Buddy and Lucky in celebrating friendship through sports \u2014 one pixel at a time.<br />\r\n",
    "about_the_game": "Buddy and Lucky love capturing joyful moments of their friends practicing all kinds of sports. With their camera always ready, they turn these fun memories into charming pixel-art photographs \u2014 and you\u2019re invited to help develop them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe photos are already taken, but it\u2019s up to you to bring each scene to life \u2014 character by character, pixel by pixel \u2014 transforming simple silhouettes into colorful snapshots full of personality.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Choose from 10 unique photos full of friendship, fun, and sports<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Color over 60 characters across 10 vibrant photos, each filled with style and movement<br />\r\n\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Use cozy, intuitive tools like the Eye and Lock buttons to paint at your pace<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Relax with a lighthearted soundtrack composed by Taty Jaques<br />\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Enjoy delightful pixel art created by K\u00e1tia Numakura<br />\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 Complete your collection and fill the photo album with your finished creations<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you\u2019re into coloring, pixel art, or just looking for a relaxing moment, join Buddy and Lucky in celebrating friendship through sports \u2014 one pixel at a time.<br />\r\n",
